{"3764340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Last Stack Standing", "steam_appid": 3764340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Last Stack Standing</i></strong> - <i>a grim balancing simulator trapped in mysterious geometry. You wake up in a seven-sided room without a ceiling, where eternal night seeps through wall cracks. Your goal is to build upward, surviving among &quot;rivals&quot; whose silhouettes flicker in the windows. But beware: these players aren't your main threat...</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Physics</u>: Real-time simulation of object behavior, weight, friction, and center of mass.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Architecture</u>: 7-sided room with optical illusions, each corner more dangerous than the last. Color palette of despair with unexpected bright accents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Competition</u>: Survive and become the best among the living.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival Modes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Story</u>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the tallest tower from given objects within time limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Rival's Shadow</u>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exactly recreate opponent's structure before timer expires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Chaos</u>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable objects - shaking, sudden heaviness, escaping items. Build faster despite chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Ghost</u>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items phase through each other until you stop touching them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Frenemy</u>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-player co-op mode using two hands to create the impossible.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Last Stack Standing</i></strong> - <i>a grim balancing simulator trapped in mysterious geometry. You wake up in a seven-sided room without a ceiling, where eternal night seeps through wall cracks. Your goal is to build upward, surviving among &quot;rivals&quot; whose silhouettes flicker in the windows. But beware: these players aren't your main threat...</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Physics</u>: Real-time simulation of object behavior, weight, friction, and center of mass.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Architecture</u>: 7-sided room with optical illusions, each corner more dangerous than the last. Color palette of despair with unexpected bright accents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Competition</u>: Survive and become the best among the living.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival Modes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Story</u>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the tallest tower from given objects within time limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Rival's Shadow</u>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exactly recreate opponent's structure before timer expires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Chaos</u>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable objects - shaking, sudden heaviness, escaping items. Build faster despite chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Ghost</u>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items phase through each other until you stop touching them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Frenemy</u>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-player co-op mode using two hands to create the impossible.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Last Stack Standing - a noir physics stacking game. Build wobbling towers from household items in competitive 1vsAll modes. Master realistic physics as your creations collapse. Only the steadiest hands will survive this shadowy showdown.", "supported_languages": "Russian, English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764340/5b047f65ab97c398d6100a9a1d2945d62fc804da/header.jpg?t=1786385440", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764340/f3ebcdd134aab6cc089b037635f3b10454f0405a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786385440", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764340/f3ebcdd134aab6cc089b037635f3b10454f0405a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786385440", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E6420, AMD Athlon x2 5800+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 7800<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Quad, AMD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 8800GT, AMD<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["ByVed"], "publishers": ["ByVed Games "], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 49, "description": "PvP"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 64, "description": "Adjustable Text Size"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 66, "description": "Colo